    "td-mode-ffa.png": "Dawn Free for All: TD MTNK.SHP body+turret frames 20/52, 12/44, 28/60, 4/36 with RemapGold, RemapRed, RemapLtBlue, RemapGreen (tiberiandawn/const.cpp), Scale2x, converging on TD FBALL1.SHP frame 5 at its own size; Dawn gunmetal plate",
