    "td-mode-rally.png": "Dawn Rally: TD BGGY.SHP (RemapRed) leading JEEP.SHP (RemapGold), body+turret frames 28/60 (north-east), Scale2x, racing for a drawn chequered line of 6px squares; TD FLAGFLY.SHP frame 0 with its cloth (indices 176..191 and 115..119) chequered in its own shading, Scale2x; Dawn gunmetal plate",
